# Turn: Father Vane speaks. He explains: the iron nails were never meant to seal the monster IN the mine. They were meant to keep the well's original inhabitant OUT of the mine — because the mine chamber is the only place on earth where the entity can be permanently destroyed. By rusting the nails, Father Vane has been trying to lure it back. He has been working toward this for eleven years. He needed the party to open the chamber. They were never investigators. They were keys. Roll Insight DC 20 Dorian. Roll History DC 17 Emmett.

